id: autonomous-ultra-instinct-in-the-realm-of-angels
name: In the Realm of Angels
order: 2
slot: trait
description: >
  You have ascended beyond the mortal nature of your birth and achieved divine skill previously unknown to the universe at large.
text: >
  In the Realm of Angels: You have ascended beyond the mortal nature of your birth and achieved divine skill previously unknown to the universe at large.
  (1)-[Passive]: You do not trigger the Exploit Maneuver unless you are suffering from the Guard Down or Impediment Combat Conditions.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Turn]: You may spend 3(bT) Divine Ki Points to remove a Combat Condition you are suffering from (except Pinned, Suffocating, Transfigured, or Poisoned). You may repeat this effect any number of times.
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Enter the Zen level of the Mindful State until the start of your next turn.

---

# (1) No Exploit but Guard Down or Impediment, (2) Divine Ki to shed a Combat Condition: the table's.

# (3) With the Power Up, once a Round: the Mindful State's Zen level till the start of your next turn (its level the table's).
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 3]
enterState(mindful, 1, start-of-next-turn);
